      en: ["Jubail's total population exceeds 470,000.", "Jubail Industrial City was the largest single-phase construction project in the world.", "The city has the largest desalination plant in the Middle East.", "Jubail Mangrove Park is an important ecological area that protects the coastline.", "The city is home to Jubail Industrial College and Jubail Technical Institute.", "King Fahd Industrial Port is one of the busiest ports in the world.", "During the 1991 Gulf War, Jubail was severely affected by an oil spill."],
      es: ["Decreto real para ciudad industrial el 21 de septiembre de 1975", "Unos 380.000 habitantes en la Provincia Oriental", "Una de las mayores zonas petroquímicas del mundo", "King Fahd Industrial Port con capacidad de más de 80 millones de toneladas", "Cuartel general de los marines estadounidenses en la Segunda Guerra del Golfo 1991", "Comisión Real para Jubail y Yanbu fundada en 1975", "Ruinas cristianas del siglo IV descubiertas en 1986", "Sede de importantes plantas SABIC"],
