      en: ["Al-Qurayyat's population exceeds 190,000.", "The city is only 30 kilometers from the Jordanian border.", "Ka'af Castle is a historic fortress nearby.", "Numerous ancient Nabataean and Roman artifacts have been found in the region.", "Al-Qurayyat is also known as the 'city of salt'.", "The city is an important route for Hajj pilgrims from the Levant region.", "The region's climate is continental, with hot summers and cold winters, sometimes with snow."],
