      en: ["Tarout Island covers an area of about 70 square kilometers.", "The island's name is likely derived from the Phoenician goddess Astarte.", "Tarout Castle was built from local sea stones and gypsum.", "The 'Naked Man' statue is one of the most important Dilmun-era artifacts.", "The island was an important center for pearl diving.", "Dareen Port, in the south of the island, was once one of the most important ports in the region.", "The island is home to numerous Shia Muslim holy sites."],
